[{"title":"缺题","author":"陆树声","text":"熙熙丽日开青野，漠漠平畴散碧波。\n山鸟一声催布谷，绿杨阴里听农歌。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":23352,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"缺题","author":"曹勋","text":"罗绮生香散隐霞，春光不让五侯家。\n东风二月苏堤路，树树桃花间柳花。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":23353,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"夏日","author":"王象晋","text":"祝融司令继芳春，四望郊原乐事均。\n翠浪翻池荷盖绿，黄云布垄麦痕新。\n榴花焰焰红喷火，葵叶翩翩影应辰。\n偃仰茂林逃酷暑，呼朋酌酒莫辞频。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":23354,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"夏日","author":"吴宽","text":"绿荫松萝暑气凉，清泉泻入小池塘。\n人间昼永无聊赖，一朵荷花满院香。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":23355,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"秋夜简敬承公亮","author":"冯琦","text":"秋色遽如许，客心郁未安。\n微微日影薄，肃肃天宇宽。\n高风下木叶，零露被崇兰。\n四气自斡运，谁为衰盛端。\n朱华曾几何，素萼忽已残。\n楚楚松柏姿，凌风以自完。\n愿言附高节，与君同岁寒。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":23356,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"秋望","author":"张祥鸢","text":"快阁临飞鸟，遥天入断峰。\n白云山面面，红叶树重重。\n空翠当杯落，晴光刺眼浓。\n愿言随楚客，木末采芙蓉。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":23357,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"缺题","author":"陆树声","text":"独怜秋色倍清幽，花月娟娟夜气浮。\n满院风飘香欲散，一天云净影交流。\n光摇皓魄庭如水，寒染霜葩玉作毬。\n把酒啜英誇二美，赏心还以继前修。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":23358,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"昭君怨","author":"陈继儒","text":"记得东坡老叟，莫负清明重九。\n今日正重阳，菊花黄。\n花插满头归去，落日前村枫树。\n树里唱歌声，钓渔人。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":23359,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"缺题","author":"王象晋","text":"蜡祭喧喧土鼓搓，纷纷髦稚拥如波。\n咏幽恍际周王世，布令行宣青帝和。\n冰箸迎阳辞碧瓦，梅珠散彩耀繁柯。\n春光积渐来茅舍，对酒能忘鼓腹歌。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":23360,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"京师尝吴粳","author":"高启","text":"新粳粲如玉，远漕来中吴。\n初尝爱精凿，想出官田租。\n我本东皋民，少年习耕锄。\n霜天万穗熟，恣啄从饥乌。\n日暮刈穫归，妻孥共欢呼。\n茅屋夜舂急，风雨江村孤。\n晨炊满家香，荐以出网鲈。\n如今幸蒙恩，遨游在南都。\n门前半区田，别来想已芜。\n长年盗寸廪，补报一事无。\n投匕忽叹息，饱食惭农夫。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":23361,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"采桑玉堂阴二首答篁墩学士 其一","author":"李东阳","text":"采桑玉堂阴，分蚕长安郭。\n一劳累百枚，再分连数箔。\n宁知富贵地，此物能沃若。\n平生?亩忧，黾勉怀力作。\n嗟彼衣锦儿，空言养蚕乐。\n吴机咏濯濯，周叶歌莫莫。\n遗我通家人，同心故相托。\n爱之敢轻弃，弱女方就学。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":23362,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"采桑玉堂阴二首答篁墩学士 其二","author":"李东阳","text":"采桑玉堂阴，阴浓树婆娑。\n一采不满筐，竟日能几何。\n乃知富贵地，不及穷山阿。\n蚕成忽满眼，所得良亦多。\n人言系家运，或者阴阳和。\n向非夙夜勤，岂恃叶与柯。\n衣多必思寒，吾民本同科。\n欲将分蚕意，广被无偏颇。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":23363,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"画菜","author":"李东阳","text":"谁写西园数叶菘，露华清晓湿蒙茸。\n玉堂夜半苏郎渴，此味无因献九重。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":23364,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"苦菜二首 其一","author":"黄正色","text":"但得菜根俱可啖，况于苦荬亦奇逢。\n初尝不解回甘味，惯醉方知醒酒功。\n茹素无缘荤未断，禅宗有约障难空。\n北窗入夏稀盘饾，莫厌频频饷阿侬。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":23365,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"苦菜二首 其二","author":"黄正色","text":"盘餐落落对瓜畦，杜撰人间苦荬齑。\n嫩绿浮羹莼让滑，微酸入口舌应迷。\n野人生计谁云薄，藿食家风未是低。\n为报青蝇莫相点，欲随芹曝献金闺。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":23366,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"缺题","author":"陈继儒","text":"十亩之郊，菜叶荠花。\n抱瓮灌之，乐哉农家。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":23367,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"咏藜","author":"李东阳","text":"藜新尚可蒸，藜老亦堪煮。\n明年幸强健，拄杖看秋雨。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":23368,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"太湖采莼并引 其一","author":"邹斯盛","text":"春暖冰芽茁，秋深味更清。\n有花开水底，是叶贴湖平。\n野客分云种，山厨带露烹。\n橘黄霜白后，对酒奈何情。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":23369,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"太湖采莼并引 其二","author":"邹斯盛","text":"风静绿生烟，烟中荡小船。\n香丝萦手滑，清供得秋鲜。\n荇叶分圆缺，鲈鱼相后先。\n谁云是千里，采采自今年。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":23370,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"莼菜","author":"高启","text":"紫丝浮半滑，波上老秋风。\n忆共香菰荐，吴江叶艇中。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":23371,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"缺题","author":"陈继儒","text":"春水渐宽，青青者芹。\n君且留此，弹余素琴。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":23372,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"芹","author":"高启","text":"饭煮忆青泥，羹炊思碧涧。\n无路献君门，对案增三叹。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":23373,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"摘瓠","author":"高启","text":"轮囷卧霜露，秋晓摘初归。\n自笑诗人骨，何由似尔肥。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":23374,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题画茄","author":"吴宽","text":"种茄粪壤中，地力亦易竭。\n厥状虽不同，难将味分别。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":23375,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"试茶","author":"陈继儒","text":"绮阴攒盖，灵草试奇。\n竹炉幽讨，松火怒飞。\n水交以淡，茗战而肥。\n绿香满路，永日忘归。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":23376,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"茶轩","author":"高启","text":"摘芳试新泉，手涤林下器。\n一榻鬓丝傍，轻烟散遥吹。\n不用醒吟魂，幽人自无睡。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":23377,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"龙井茶","author":"于若瀛","text":"西湖之西开龙井，烟霞近接南峰岭。\n飞流蜜汨写幽壑，石磴纡曲片云冷。\n拄杖寻源到上方，松枝半落澄潭静。\n铜瓶试取烹新茶，涛起龙团沸谷芽。\n中顶无须忧兽迹，湖州岂惧涸金沙。\n漫道白芽双井嫩，未必红泥方印嘉。\n世人品茶未尝见，但说天池与阳羡。\n岂知新茗煮新泉，团黄分洌浮瓯面。\n二枪浪白附三篇，一串应输钱五万。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":23378,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"谢人惠茶","author":"潘允哲","text":"长日燕台正忆家，故人新惠故园茶。\n茸分玉碾闻兰气，火煖金铛见雪花。\n漫道玉川阳羡蕊，还如鸿渐建溪芽。\n泠然一啜烦襟涤，欲御天风弄紫霞。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":23379,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"缺题","author":"陈继儒","text":"山中日日试新泉，君合前身老玉川。\n石枕月侵蕉叶梦，竹炉风软落花烟。\n点来直是窥三昧，醒后翻能赋百篇。\n却笑当年醉乡子，一生虚掷杖头钱。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":23380,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"谢人送茶","author":"王人鉴","text":"谷雨年年僧送茶，近来无复及贫家。\n伏龙手制能分饷，活火新泉试落霞。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":23381,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题画梅花","author":"于若瀛","text":"钱君手出画梅卷，零风点雪寒芳敛。\n老干横生色如铁，空山月抹孤根远。\n古今谁得傅梅神，开卷琼英寒逼人。\n漫誇范致能为谱，长老华光差得真。\n一幅一枝不为少，逐毫乱落夺天巧。\n影灭香消破碧虚，含飙出雾何缥缈。\n逋翁湖山诗思清，扬州东阁最含情。\n瘦花数点应难谢，不受江南笛里声。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":23382,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"缺题","author":"申时行","text":"筑圃双林畔，看花百卉先。\n含春俱绰约，缀雪暂清妍。\n景弄孤山月，香分庾岭天。\n任教催白发，索笑自年年。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":23383,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"缺题","author":"陈继儒","text":"潦倒鹿裘寒，探梅草未乾。\n拈花先命酒，钓雪戏投竿。\n客去鸟声碎，山高屐齿删。\n不辞松底卧，一任老袁安。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":23384,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"梅花","author":"申时行","text":"庾岭春姿占早芳，梁园夜色转辉光。\n毰毸已见花如霰，瑩洁还疑玉有香。\n积处寒侵姑射骨，融来暗洗寿阳妆。\n此时独对遥相忆，吹笛关山总断肠。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":23385,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"水边梅","author":"张祥鸢","text":"花信风娇花事迟，梅花春半未盈枝。\n暗香稍稍能相媚，冷蕊娟娟不自持。\n影落清池摇水镜，标凝残雪瘦琼姿。\n细看疑是罗浮夜，月淡参横恼梦思。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":23386,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"梅花","author":"邹之麟","text":"满天飞雪少人行，野寺东边鹤数声。\n閒淡可参仁者静，丰神已造圣之清。\n尝称宫阁曾相见，不道孤山浪有名。\n欲折一枝供大士，疏篱隔断水盈盈。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":23387,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"梅花","author":"王凤雏","text":"由来王氏人多癖，我爱梅花癖最深。\n新构小楼偏有韵，移来几树欲成阴。\n村人近解呼梅里，胜客相将拟竹林。\n莫讶莺啼犹未起，纵然蝶化也相寻。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":23388,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"泥金梅","author":"李东阳","text":"梨花如雪柳如金，俗眼犹将较浅深。\n争似能黄更能白，两般颜色一般心。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":23389,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"梅花","author":"张新","text":"腊破春从碧海回，人人争爱说花魁。\n如何费尽平章力，不道人间有绿梅。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":23390,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"缺题","author":"刘文光","text":"玉手纤纤捧玉杯，仙郎南去几时回。\n天涯到处生芳草，须记凌寒雪里梅。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":23391,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题延平刘郎中廷信所藏红梅三首 其一","author":"李东阳","text":"美人家住越江城，翠袖红颜最有情。\n犹是江南无雪地，雪中看得更分明。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":23392,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题延平刘郎中廷信所藏红梅三首 其二","author":"李东阳","text":"莫种西湖浅水滨，水清花艳各伤神。\n春光不与花相妒，花到开时却妒春。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":23393,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题延平刘郎中廷信所藏红梅三首 其三","author":"李东阳","text":"玄都寂寞花无主，剑浦芳菲树亦香。\n颜色似同风格异，刘郎非是旧刘郎。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":23394,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"红梅","author":"谢文爵","text":"近水穿篱压众芳，檀心一点漏春光。\n世情多厌冰霜面，故作东风冶艳妆。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":23395,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"杏花","author":"文嘉","text":"三月曲江微雨乾，东风一日遍长安。\n围烟簇粉春如海，总待新郎马上看。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":23396,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"缺题","author":"冯琦","text":"无棣城边春欲暮，卧龙冈上花如雾。\n年年醉彻武陵烟，至今记得桃源路。\n桃源遍地桃花水，翠屏高傍层城起。\n宁可馀姿点绿芜，?将浮艳誇秾李。\n始看一径盘空曲，渐入千枝散朝旭。\n满树残霞烂不收，一天香雨飞红玉。\n白云深锁扬子居，青山自爱陶公庐。\n平芜十里閒看鸟，春水一竿不羡鱼。\n大隐何须分出处，赏心岂必长林莽。\n桃李浓滋华省阴，公门自是韶华主。\n绥山一颗忆仙家，绝胜河阳万树花。\n岁岁愿公悬水镜，长将秋实代春华。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":23397,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"桃溪","author":"申时行","text":"分得元都种，依然玉洞春。\n逶迤成曲径，烂漫及芳辰。\n锦叠溪边浪，红销雨后尘。\n武陵差可拟，吾岂避秦人。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":23398,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"桃花","author":"陆卿子","text":"一睹倾城貌，千山敛夕霏。\n露桃差比艳，汀月借生辉。\n蹑蹬云迎袜，凌波水溅衣。\n馀芳吹不散，常绕渚烟飞。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":23399,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"缺题","author":"张虚庵","text":"笑披初服返林皋，小筑精庐榜慕陶。\n已买扁舟浮绿水，更依疏柳插红桃。\n春风荏苒来三径，岁月侵寻入二毛。\n却笑文章缘业在，箧书重简课儿曹。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":23400,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"缺题","author":"方广德","text":"露井花时露未晞，紫文丹萼斗芳菲。\n佳人南国还娇艳，仙种西池定是非。\n浥雨别含浓淡态，笼烟怯逗浅深晖。\n祇缘琼貌难为侣，独傍房陵片玉飞。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":23401,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"缺题","author":"曹大章","text":"竹径寥寥空碧苔，双星忽漫照高台。\n唾飞白玉风前落，舄度青云江上来。\n螭尾清班原帝侍，虎头词客总仙才。\n相逢莫问年来事，惟有桃花似旧开。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":23402,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题桃花","author":"陈道复","text":"春光何烂漫，桃花发满溪。\n武陵香万树，宁不放人题。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":23403,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"桃花","author":"李东阳","text":"种树乘春雨，开花待晓风。\n一年还一树，随意满园红。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":23404,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"缺题","author":"孙慎行","text":"桃源只在市城边，锦瑟明妆满画船。\n莫怪道人回首处，朝来暮去已年年。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":23405,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"缺题","author":"孙齐之","text":"秋夜佳人歌木兰，潇湘幅上水云寒。\n谁教蕙帐留春色，九月桃花镜里看。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":23406,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"缺题","author":"杜赞","text":"孔雀屏开春梦幽，水晶帘捲篆烟浮。\n深宫尽日浑无事，閒看桃花落御沟。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":23407,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"缺题","author":"邓志谟","text":"风扫桃花片片飞，夜阑不寐倚屏围。\n声声杜宇催归去，不向郎啼向妾啼。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":23408,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"缺题","author":"丘陵","text":"芳郊晴日草萋萋，千树桃花一鸟啼。\n无数落红随水去，又分春色入城西。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":23409,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"缺题","author":"徐臣","text":"不骋娇姿媚艳阳，却来冒雪并寒芳。\n应嫌春色繁华态，故学梅花浅淡妆。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":23410,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"缺题","author":"储氏","text":"夭桃灼灼倚窗前，春色缤纷带紫烟。\n昨夜雨声来枕上，惜花人听不曾眠。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":23411,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"咏李","author":"李东阳","text":"名果出吾家，移栽自海涯。\n要看花胜雪，先放雨催花。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":23412,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"梨花","author":"张新","text":"粉翅还嫌蝶太轻，雪衣偏喜燕多情。\n宁王玉笛知何处，寂寞黄昏伴月明。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":23413,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"石榴一首赠方石","author":"李东阳","text":"桃溪老人爱花树，家在万花溪上住。\n白头重入紫薇垣，官舍今无种花处。\n买花不识城市途，园中看花非我徒。\n画图剪綵尽成幻，空有爱花犹故吾。\n吾家海榴四五株，意欲借之如借书。\n自言花借不在好，仅取数尺青扶疏。\n墙根老枝不盈掬，欲借真惭少装束。\n风披雨浥渐成阴，纵遣无花看亦足。\n城西官陌无尘埃，呼童把送休迟回。\n花根岁暮幸勿返，还我诗逋十韵来。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":23414,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"榴花","author":"李东阳","text":"未摘霜前实，先看雨后花。\n名应出西海，颜岂论东家。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":23415,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"缺题","author":"张新","text":"日向午临疑喷火，雨从晨洗欲流脂。\n酡颜剩照双眸醉，珠腹还成百子奇。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":23416,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"缺题","author":"王象晋","text":"翠袖参差瑞色新，棱嶒老干拥祥云。\n无边生意包涵厚，满腹珠玑取次陈。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":23417,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"晨起观荷花","author":"申时行","text":"水榭临文漪，晨㬢出旸谷。\n宛彼芙蕖花，嫣然媚初旭。\n焕若丹霞敷，晔如锦云簇。\n秾艳复芬馡，可以娱心目。\n须臾日渐中，敛华閟清馥。\n匪乏倾阳姿，将无避炎燠。\n舒卷固有时，昕晡递相续。\n努力爱朝晖，寸阴如尺玉。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":23418,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"莲花","author":"张祥鸢","text":"日气沉山紫，荷花照水明。\n香含风细细，影浸月盈盈。\n妃子华清浴，神君洛浦行。\n向人娇欲语，解语恐倾城。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":23419,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"秋莲","author":"冯琦","text":"坐对芙蓉沼，行歌棠棣吟。\n相依香漠漠，独立影沉沉。\n人自怜芳艳，谁当识苦心。\n秋风渐萧索，结子已如今。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":23420,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"内阁五月莲花盛开和太子太保刘公韵二首 其一","author":"李东阳","text":"十分芳气袭人清，未羡兰蕤更菊英。\n尽去秾华还古淡，绝无言笑有风情。\n根含瀛海波涛润，色藉天家雨露荣。\n见说中通能外直，此心端合与花盟。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":23421,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}}]